# Frontend Guidelines (Next.js)

- Next.js runs in `/frontend` using App Router (`src/app`).
- Use Tailwind CSS with emerald, teal, and slate for a modern clinical UI.
- Use TypeScript with strict typing.
- Put reusable UI in `/frontend/src/components`.
- Prefer Server Components; add `'use client'` only for interactive forms (appointment booking, contact form, etc.).
